EDVR unofficial patch — https://github.com/characterecho-sean/edvr-unofficial-patch
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 characterecho-sean. Full text: tools/EDVR-LICENSE.txt
  - tools/gen_exports.py: EDVR's export thunk generator, copied unchanged; build/gen/edvr_* are its output,
    and src/proxy.cc uses the edvr_* names it generates. tools/gen_exports_from_release.py (edworld's own) runs
    it on the export list of a released EDVR d3d11.dll at build time; no EDVR binary is part of edworld.
  - src/proxy.cc: the proxy chaining discipline of EDVR's src/d3d11/d3d11_proxy.cpp (system copy loaded in
    DllMain, next proxy on the first export call, depth guard for a next proxy that asks for d3d11.dll by name).
  - src/hooks.cc: lessons from EDVR and its Proton issue 65 (per-draw work kept to a pointer compare, GPU copies
    into staging read back with DO_NOT_WAIT instead of CPU reads of mapped dynamic buffers).
  - src/panel_math.h: the shader hash EDVR names shaders by (FNV-1a 64 over the bytecode) and EDVR's decode of
    the cockpit panels' instance record (fss_panel_rect.cpp, fss_panel_vs.h); what EDVR measured about the
    panel shaders' constant buffers.

